#      printed passes
#   b) mutations anchored on the first matching return landed in the ERROR
#      branch and failed to COMPILE, which a naive runner reports as RED
#   c) git clean -fd deleted worktree node_modules symlinks, so six "reds"
#      were module-resolution errors
#
# THE VERDICT FORMAT IS SHIP IT / SHIP IT WITH X / DO NOT SHIP.
